# Rename this file to .simulator_enabled to enable the 'Simulator' region
# in the Aqua Medic config flow.
#
# This file is git-ignored; it must be created manually on each dev machine.
# Never commit .simulator_enabled to git — it must not appear in production.
#
# To enable:  cp simulator_enabled.example .simulator_enabled
# To disable: rm .simulator_enabled
